    <h1 class="article-title">Your PDF Is a Lie<br><em>What the Metadata Says vs What the Document Says</em></h1>
    <p class="article-subtitle">Five scenarios where the hidden metadata in a PDF directly contradicts what the document claims. Real ExifTool output shows exactly what a recipient sees.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>&#128197; October 2026</span>
      <span>&#9201; 13 min read</span>
      <span>&#9998; FileIntel</span>
      <span>&#128203; Original research</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-warning">&#9888; Your own documents may contain these contradictions right now</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual" id="hero-visual">
    <div class="hero-visual-inner" id="hero-visual-inner">
      <img src="/images/pdf-metadata-mismatch.jpg" alt="PDF metadata mismatch showing visible document details beside conflicting hidden metadata" width="720" height="720" loading="eager" class="hero-img" id="hero-img" />
